211864,"idMal":null,"isAdult":false,"poster":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/medium/bx211864-KDeW0aXxJUye.jpg","title":{"english":null,"native":"MYSTERIOUS STAR","romaji":"MYSTERIOUS STAR","userPreferred":"MYSTERIOUS STAR"}},"relationType":"CHARACTER","resolved":true}],"schemaVersion":"1.1.0","score":{"scale":100,"source":"anilist","value":59},"season":"SUMMER","seasonYear":2001,"series":["al-4024"],"seriesIds":[4024],"startDate":{"day":20,"month":7,"year":2001},"status":"FINISHED","studios":[{"animation":false,"id":150,"name":"Sanrio"},{"animation":true,"id":86,"name":"Group TAC"}],"synopsis":{"language":null,"source":"anilist","spoiler":false,"text":"Hello Kitty and other Sanrio characters star in adaptations of various fairy tales from all over the world.\n\nThis entry contains:\n\n1. Hello kitty no Shirayukihime / Hello Kitty in \"Snow White and the Seven Dwarfs\" (ハローキティの白雪姫)\n\n2. Bad Badtz-maru no Ookami ga Kita! / Badtz-Maru in \"The Shepherd Boy and the Wolf\"  (バッドばつ丸のオオカミが来た！)\n\n3. Pochakko no Jack to Mame no ki / Pochacco in \"Jack and the Beanstalk\"  (ポチャッコのジャックと豆の木)\n\n4. Hello Kitty no Susama no Mimi wa Roba no Mimi / Hello Kitty & Mimmy in \"The Story of King Midas\"  (ハローキティの王様の耳はロバの耳)\n\n5. Hello Kitty no Hansel to Gretel / Hello Kitty & Dear Daniel in \"Hansel & Gretel\"  (ハローキティのヘンゼルとグレーテル)\n\n6. My Melody no Akazukin / My Melody in \"Little Red Riding Hood\"  (マイメロディの赤ずきん)\n\n7. Hello Kitty no Kaguya-Hime / Hello Kitty in \"The Bamboo Princess\"  (ハローキティのかぐや姫)\n\n8. Hangyodon no Hadaka no Ousama / Hangyodon in \"The Emperor's New Clothes\"  (ハンギョドンのはだかの王様)\n\n9. Hello Kitty no Nemureru Mori no Bijo / Hello Kitty in \"Sleeping Beauty\"  (ハローキティのねむれる森の美女)\n\n10. Bad Badtz-Maru no Ari to Kirigirisu / Badtz-Maru in \"The Ants and the Grasshopper\"  (バッドばつ丸のアリとキリギリス)\n\n11. Hello Kitty no Hakuchou no Ouji / Hello Kitty in \"The Wild Swans\"  (ハローキティの白鳥の王子)\n\n12. O Saru no Monkichi no Kin no Ono Gin no Ono / Monkichi in \"Mercury and the Workmen\"  (おさるのもんきちの金の斧 銀の斧)\n\n13. Hello Kitty no Kurumiwari Ningyou / Hello Kitty in \"The Nutcracker\"  (ハローキティのくるみ割り人形)\n\n14. Corocorokuririn no Inaka no Nezumi Tokai no Nezumi / Corocorokuririn in \"The Country Mouse and the Town Mouse\"  (コロコロクリリンの田舎のネズミ都会のネズミ)\n\n15. Hello Kitty no Momotarou / Hello Kitty in \"Momotaro\"  (ハローキティの桃太郎)\n\n16. Pompompurin no Usagi to Kame / Pompompurin in \"The Tortoise and the Hare\" (ポムポムプリンのウサギとカメ)\n\n17. Hello Kitty no Cinderella / Hello Kitty in \"Cinderella\"  (ハローキティのシンデレラ)\n\n18. Ahiru no Pekkle no Ahiru no Drakestail / Pekkle in \"Drakestail\"  (アヒルのペックルのアヒルのドレイクステール)\n\n19. Kero Kero Keroppi no Arajin to Mahou no Ranpu / Keroppi in \"Aladdin and the Magic Lamp\"  (けろけろけろっぴのアラジンと魔法のランプ)\n\n20. Hello Kitty no Match Uri no Shoujo / Hello Kitty in \"The Little Match Girl\"  (ハローキティのマッチ売りの少女)\n\n21. Hello Kitty no Nagagutsu o Haita Neko / Hello Kitty in \"Puss in Boots\"  (ハローキティの長靴をはいた猫)\n\n22. Ahiru no Pekkle no Minikui Ahiru no ko / Pekkle in \"The Ugly Duckling\"  (アヒルのペックルのみにくいアヒルの子)\n\n23. Hello Kitty no o Yayu bi Hime / Hello Kitty in \"Thumbelina\"  (ハローキティのおやゆび姫)\n\n24. Pompompurin no Kitakaze to Taiyou / Pompompurin in \"The North Wind and the Sun\"  (ポムポムプリンの北風と太陽)\n\n25. Hello Kitty no Yuki no Joou / Hello Kitty & Dear Daniel in \"The Snow Queen\"  (ハローキティの雪の女王)\n\n26. Hello Kitty no 3 Hiki no ko Buta / Hello Kitty, Mimmy, & Dear Daniel in \"The Three Little Pigs\"  (ハローキティの3匹の子ぶた)"},"tags":[{"name":"Fairy Tale","rank":79,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Kids","rank":60,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Animals","rank":53,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Classic Literature","rank":20,"spoiler":false}],"titles":{"display":"Hello Kitty’s Animation Theater","english":"Hello Kitty’s Animation Theater","native":"サンリオ・アニメ世界名作劇場","romaji":"Sanrio Anime Sekai Gekijou","synonyms":[]},"trailer":null,"visibility":"general"}